{"id":67345,"date":"2024-10-18T14:26:35","date_gmt":"2024-10-18T13:26:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67345"},"modified":"2026-09-29T10:44:15","modified_gmt":"2026-09-29T09:44:15","slug":"sao-silvestre-olivais","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-olivais\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre dos Olivais 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre dos Olivais 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre dos Olivais 2026<\/strong> (36\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se na noite de quarta-feira, <strong>30 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, afirmando-se como a corrida de S\u00e3o Silvestre mais antiga e carism\u00e1tica da cidade de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Promovida pela <strong>Junta de Freguesia dos Olivais<\/strong>, a prova enche as art\u00e9rias hist\u00f3ricas e bairros tradicionais dos Olivais com uma atmosfera festiva inigual\u00e1vel de celebra\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva de encerramento de ano.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o junto \u00e0s instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Junta de Freguesia, o programa arranca com a <strong>Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre<\/strong> \u00e0s 20h30 para os mais jovens, seguida da emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 21h00 e da inclusiva <strong>Caminhada de 4 km \/ Olivais Sobre Rodas<\/strong> \u00e0s 21h10. O evento inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica comemorativa de manga comprida, medalha de finalista, abastecimentos e bengaleiro de apoio aos participantes.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">30 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-bo