between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 30 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 21:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 4 km \/ Olivais Sobre Rodas<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 30 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 21:10<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre dos Olivais 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 36\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se na noite de quarta-feira, 30 de dezembro de 2026, com o in\u00edcio das partidas infantis \u00e0s 20h30 e a corrida principal \u00e0s 21h00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde est\u00e1 situado o local de partida e chegada?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e chegada realizam-se junto \u00e0 Junta de Freguesia dos Olivais, em Lisboa.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as provas e hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inclui a Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre \u00e0s 20h30, a Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 21h00 e a Caminhada de 4 km (Olivais Sobre Rodas) \u00e0s 21h10.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O kit inclui dorsal oficial com chip eletr\u00f3nico na corrida, camisola t\u00e9cnica de manga comprida, medalha de finalista e seguro desportivo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como posso garantir o dorsal e consultar o regulamento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e o regulamento oficial est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis na p\u00e1gina oficial do evento, devendo os atletas garantir a participa\u00e7\u00e3o antecipadamente.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre dos Olivais 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-30\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Junta de Freguesia dos Olivais, Lisboa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Junta de Freguesia dos Olivais\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre dos Olivais 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 36\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se na noite de quarta-feira, 30 de dezembro de 2026, com o in\u00edcio das partidas infantis \u00e0s 20h30 e a corrida principal \u00e0s 21h00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde est\u00e1 situado o local de partida e chegada?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e chegada realizam-se junto \u00e0 Junta de Freguesia dos Olivais, em Lisboa.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as provas e hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa inclui a Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre \u00e0s 20h30, a Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 21h00 e a Caminhada de 4 km (Olivais Sobre Rodas) \u00e0s 21h10.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o kit de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O kit inclui dorsal oficial com chip eletr\u00f3nico na corrida, camisola t\u00e9cnica de manga comprida, medalha de finalista e seguro desportivo.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como posso garantir o dorsal e consultar o regulamento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e o regulamento oficial est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis na p\u00e1gina oficial do evento, devendo os atletas garantir a participa\u00e7\u00e3o antecipadamente.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68961,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,478,47],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-67345","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-lisboa","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-sao-silvestre","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"h